Hi,

On the hardware described in attached alsa-info (VT1705), I=C2=A0have the
following problem:
 - mic doesn't work
 - if, while recording, we switch "input source", mic works during the
   recording session.

Passing power_save=3D0 as a parameter to snd-hda-intel solves the problem.

It was reproduced on linus' master branch, tiwai's for-next branch,
and 3.2 branch.

Regards,

Anisse

